      "zh": "交易心理与纪律"
    },
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "learningObjectives": {
      "en": [
        "Explain the core decision rules behind containing greed through planned targets and position risk.",
        "Apply containing greed through planned targets and position risk to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释通过计划目标与仓位风险约束贪婪背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将通过计划目标与仓位风险约束贪婪应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
    },
